  "sourceTitle": "Flaming Cheese",
  "sourceText": "Flaming Cheese\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, December 26, 2009 - 11:07pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 1/2 pounds Chorizo (Mexican Sausage)\n1 jar Salsa Ranchero or Victoria\n3 med. onions\n2 green peppers\n20 jalapeno peppers (seed)\n2 cloves garlic, chopped\n2 lg. cans tomato sauce\nOregano to taste\nSalt to taste\nCumin to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Skin sausage, break up and brown in olive oil. Saute onions, peppers and garlic in olive oil. Combine both sausage and pepper mixture and add rest of ingredients in large pot. Simmer 2 hours.",
